given: arch2.bear-enters

phase Predator response

  step too-close: pasture sends Predator entering safe perimiter
    note: Deterrence inside the safe perimeter.
    then soi.pm is Predator counteraction
    then message Light burst
    then message Sound burst

  step backs-off: pasture sends Predator leaving safe perimiter
    note: The bear backs off: back to tracking.
    then soi.pm is Predator tracking
